      "statistical_basis": "Averaged over R=2000 stochastic realizations; error bars denote 1 standard deviation. Fit performed using weighted least squares with weights given by inverse variances.",
      "uncertainty": "Amplitude uncertainty +/- 5.010e4 and exponent uncertainty +/- 0.052 are reported as plus/minus values with unspecified meaning (source_unspecified).",
      "depends_on": [],
