      "statement": "At temperature T=1, the incompressible kinetic energy at equilibration time scales with quench duration as E_i = (9.543 +/- 2.951) x 10^4 * tau_Q^{-0.935 +/- 0.068}, consistent with the predicted tau_Q^{-1} scaling.",
